# Runner .env of the persistent executor runner (T6.2a S9): copy to /home/pruefstand/pruefstand/runner/.env (owner).
# The hooks are the scripts of a separate, stable clone of the private repo at /home/pruefstand/pruefstand-gate
# (cloned once by the owner as pruefstand, `git pull --ff-only` after each sync; D1096): never the owner's dev
# checkout and never a job workspace under runner/_work/ (the hooks wipe that).
ACTIONS_RUNNER_HOOK_JOB_STARTED=/home/pruefstand/pruefstand-gate/infra/gate-executor/host/job_started.sh
ACTIONS_RUNNER_HOOK_JOB_COMPLETED=/home/pruefstand/pruefstand-gate/infra/gate-executor/host/job_completed.sh
